Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Last Flower Spark
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 45
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Xilan Tree…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it end up like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.03,0:00:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s all your fault for just playing in the mud
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.87,0:00:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and failing to protect the Xilan Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the ones who thought we were lazy—we aren’t lazy at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop arguing; the top priority is to prevent the Xilan Tree from collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.48,0:01:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the Power of Light Cotton is useless this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.69,0:01:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t let the Xilan Tree fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.49,0:01:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can’t so many of us stop the Xilan Tree from collapsing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.81,0:01:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.65,0:01:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.01,0:01:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Can someone tell me what I should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.48,0:01:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So, when we Flower Babies evolve,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.02,0:01:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to answer the Xilan Tree’s questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.86,0:02:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I answer when the time comes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.21,0:02:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the Xilan Tree can ask questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.81,0:02:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it can answer my question, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.46,0:02:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.33,0:02:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Little one, you’d better go hide over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.89,0:02:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s dangerous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.72,0:02:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I’m on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.77,0:02:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Grow, Bamboo Node!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.20,0:02:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s Lan Baobao’s voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.64,0:02:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.05,0:02:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.69,0:02:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness Weslie was in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.37,0:03:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to the Trial Grounds
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.45,0:03:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,to ask the Xilan Tree how to save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.41,0:03:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.09,0:03:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When a Flower Baby is evolving,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.73,0:03:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,it can communicate with the Xilan Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll take you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao and I will go up to the Trial Grounds to find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.92,0:03:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys go down to a safe place and wait for me to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we’ll wait for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.55,0:03:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.22,0:03:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao, we need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.95,0:03:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The door has opened; let’s go in quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.86,0:04:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower Baby
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.93,0:04:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower Baby, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.01,0:04:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You have found a special Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.17,0:04:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you can choose to join the Flower Tribe or the Silt Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Xilan Tree, the withered leaves you shed are scattered everywhere outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.54,0:04:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Flowers keep withering, and a large hole has appeared in your roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.85,0:04:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me how to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.58,0:04:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Xilan Tree, I beg you…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.49,0:04:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,please answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has ever asked me a question before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How to save the Xilan Tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.05,0:05:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t depend on me; it depends on you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the core of the Xilan Tree—the source of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.93,0:05:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.01,0:05:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,the Spark formed by the fusion of the two tribes has sustained the Xilan Tree’s energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this seed be…the Flower Tribe and the Silt Tribe…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But because of their long-standing estrangement,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the Spark—which was meant to thrive through their connection—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.02,0:05:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,gradually lost its bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My power has been fading away, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The destruction of the Xilan Tree…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,is because of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Xilan Tree, just you wait—I will definitely save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.31,0:05:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.91,0:06:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Xilan Tree
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The connection to the Xilan Tree was temporarily interrupted by the earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.43,0:06:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But we should be able to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.47,0:06:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right—I know how to save the Xilan Tree now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to tell everyone right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.30,0:06:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Our home is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The energy will gradually vanish from the top down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, even the land itself will disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Xilan Tree
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.90,0:07:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it that no matter how hard we try,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.02,0:07:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,we still can’t save the Xilan Tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.43,0:07:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.03,0:07:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.47,0:07:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I just heard the Xilan Tree’s voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.23,0:07:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It said that the destruction was caused by the estrangement
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,between the Flower Tribe and the Silt Tribe, leading to an imbalance in our Sparks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.55,0:07:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So, everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.91,0:07:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,our two tribes must join hands and work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s combine the power of both our tribes and infuse it into the Xilan Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The fused energy from the two tribes was actually absorbed by the Xilan Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks like the Xilan Tree has regained its vitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll join in too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there’s still not enough energy to reach the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay, I’m here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.63,0:08:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My silt friend, where…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,…are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so few people left in the Silt Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.03,0:08:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.83,0:08:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn’t have treated the Silt Tribe that way before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:08:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can evolve into the Silt Tribe form now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.55,0:09:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We possess the Silt Tribe Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.24,0:09:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you all have the Silt Tribe Spark?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.67,0:09:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, besides the Flower Spark,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,we also have the Silt Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.96,0:09:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But we were afraid the mentors wouldn’t like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.32,0:09:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby, come here; there are beautiful flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So we never mentioned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, please evolve according to your hearts’ desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.08,0:09:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But how are we Flower Babies supposed to climb up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.04,0:09:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And you need to be quick about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flower Baby Zone is running out of energy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.68,0:09:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.32,0:09:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll join in too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.44,0:09:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Flower Baby Zone runs out of energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.72,0:09:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the Flower Babies won’t be able to evolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You two really need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I’m not going to make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, you can copy things, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Copy my evolved wings now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.76,0:10:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower Baby Zone…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower Babies
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.25,0:10:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Give Lan Baobao back to me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.85,0:11:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.90,0:11:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to call myself Lan Zhuzhu now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll help too
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.73,0:11:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s work together
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.66,0:11:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The silt nourishes the flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.17,0:11:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The flowers repay the silt with fragrance
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.85,0:11:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The two tribes depend on each other
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.47,0:11:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the meaning of the silt and the flowers’ existence
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.18,0:11:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Spark that belongs to all of us. Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.87,0:12:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, we must protect the Xilan Tree together
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
